    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So what happens when I stop?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "You spin, then you stop. But the fluid in your ears keeps swirling for a little while!",
      "board": {
        "type": "lifecycle",
        "title": "Why you're dizzy",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🌀",
            "label": "Spin",
            "cue": "spin"
