        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Then my brain gets confused?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Yes! Your ears say \"still spinning!\" but your eyes say \"stopped!\" Those mixed messages make you dizzy.",
      "punch": "mixed",
      "board": {
